Source: ps3-desktop
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: PS3 Linux project <ps3@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), sudo
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: ps3-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ps3-system, dbus-user-session, sudo, xserver-xorg-core, xserver-xorg-legacy,
 xinit, xauth, x11-xserver-utils, x11-utils, xinput, xserver-xorg-input-joystick,
 xserver-xorg-input-libinput, openbox, tint2, jgmenu, pcmanfm, desktop-base, greybird-gtk-theme,
 papirus-icon-theme, dunst, lxpolkit, rxvt-unicode, network-manager-applet, pnmixer, gvfs, udev,
 systemd
Recommends: blueman, openarena, classicube
Description: PS3 desktop (Openbox on the RSX, game mode)
 Automatic login on tty1 (/etc/default/ps3-desktop: PS3_DESKTOP_USER) into an Openbox desktop on
 the RSX (Xorg modesetting with glamor): tint2 panel, PCManFM desktop, network, volume and
 notification helpers. Game mode (ps3-game) keeps a game and X resident and freezes the desktop
 helpers while it runs; gamepads move the pointer outside games. Shut down and Reboot menu
 entries, OpenArena's PS3 settings.
